        "# Part C – Sorting and Filtering\n",
        "\n",
        "### Question 9 – Sorting temperature readings\n",
        "\n",
        "The maintenance team wants to see equipment temperatures from lowest to highest.\n",
        "\n",
        "Using `equipment_temperature`:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Sort the readings using `np.sort()`.\n",
        "2. Display the three lowest readings.\n",
        "3. Display the three highest readings.\n",
        "\n",
        "Do not use Python's built-in `sorted()` function.\n"
      ],
      "id": "HODSl0j_-0VX"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
