        "id": "NBb8op-B-0VY"
      },
      "source": [
        "### Question 11 – Finding highly occupied classrooms\n",
        "\n",
        "A classroom is considered **highly occupied** when its occupancy is at least 80%.\n",
        "\n",
        "Using `weekly_occupancy`:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Create a Boolean condition for values greater than or equal to 80.\n",
        "2. Use Boolean indexing to extract all occupancy values meeting this condition.\n",
        "3. Display how many such values are present.\n"
