      "id": "QEFRmy9G-0VY"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "H9-bZx0r-0VY"
      },
      "source": [
        "# Part D – `np.where()` and Conditional Values\n",
        "\n",
        "### Question 13 – Classify classroom occupancy\n",
        "\n",
        "For a simple campus report:\n",
        "\n",
        "- 80% or above → `\"High\"`\n",
        "- Below 80% → `\"Normal\"`\n",
        "\n",
        "Take the occupancy values of the **first classroom** from `weekly_occupancy`.\n",
        "\n",
        "Use `np.where()` to create a new array called `classroom_status`.\n",
        "\n",
        "Display both the occupancy values and their status.\n"
      ],
      "id": "H9-bZx0r-0VY"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "gWCH_o61-0VY",
        "outputId": "80d7dfba-e3f7-4886-eeee-eee8a32ba70f"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "['normal' 'normal' 'high' 'normal' 'high' 'normal' 'normal']\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "# Write your code for Question 13 here\n",
        "condition=weekly_occupancy[:,0]>=80\n",
        "classroom_status=np.where(condition,\"high\",\"normal\")\n",
        "print(classroom_status)"
      ],
      "id": "gWCH_o61-0VY"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "vquAhSUa-0VZ"
      },
      "source": [
        "### Question 14 – Energy saving alert\n",
        "\n",
        "The university wants to label monthly Academic Block consumption:\n",
        "\n",
        "- More than 50,000 kWh → `\"Check\"`\n",
        "- Otherwise → `\"OK\"`\n",
        "\n",
        "Use `np.where()` and store the result in `energy_status`.\n",
        "\n",
        "Display the month, energy value and status separately.\n"
      ],
      "id": "vquAhSUa-0VZ"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "zcT3co6z-0VZ",
