      "source": [
        "# Part F – Mathematical Operations\n",
        "\n",
        "### Question 19 – Electricity bill\n",
        "\n",
        "The electricity rate is **₹8.50 per kWh**.\n",
        "\n",
        "Use vectorized multiplication to calculate the monthly electricity bill for all three facilities.\n",
        "\n",
        "Store the result as `monthly_bill`.\n",
        "\n",
        "Display the bill for the first three months.\n"
      ],
      "id": "Z_XFxn2Z-0Va"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "wZdSJ84Y-0Va",
        "outputId": "14f77b30-f4d1-43cd-e20f-4378428df3f9"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
