    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "DrhibHvG-0Vb"
      },
      "source": [
        "### Question 20 – Monthly totals\n",
        "\n",
        "The management wants to know how much electricity was consumed across the entire campus each month.\n",
        "\n",
        "Using `monthly_energy`:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Calculate the total consumption for each month.\n",
        "2. Store it as `monthly_total`.\n",
        "3. Find the highest monthly campus consumption using `np.max()`.\n",
        "4. Find the lowest monthly campus consumption.\n",
        "\n",
        "Use an appropriate `axis`.\n"
      ],
      "id": "DrhibHvG-0Vb"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "27kyfijz-0Vb",
        "outputId": "2d15601c-fc0b-4360-e2a0-d74703346934"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "[ 91500  94500  97400 100800 103900 107700 110800 114200 112400 108800\n",
            " 103200  98000]\n",
            "114200\n",
            "91500\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "# Write your code for Question 20 here\n",
        "monthly_total=np.sum(monthly_energy,axis=1)\n",
        "print(monthly_total)\n",
        "print(np.max(monthly_total))\n",
        "print(np.min(monthly_total))"
      ],
      "id": "27kyfijz-0Vb"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "54_3ZCPD-0Vb"
      },
      "source": [
        "### Question 21 – Average consumption\n",
        "\n",
        "Find the average electricity consumption of:\n",
        "\n",
        "- Academic Block\n",
        "- Library\n",
        "- Hostel\n",
        "\n",
        "Calculate one average value for each facility.\n",
        "\n",
        "Use the appropriate axis and store the result as `average_facility_energy`.\n",
        "\n",
        "Then display the facility names along with their average consumption.\n"
      ],
      "id": "54_3ZCPD-0Vb"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "rfc8y-AT-0Vb",
        "outputId": "ba8db125-1927-4008-a90d-d6a58cf95fad"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
